# See AGENTS.md for full instructions and multi-repo guidelines.

- dfnix is the NixOS distribution configuration and integration repo, NOT a monorepo for dfdisk, dfmount, dfnet.
- dfdisk, dfmount, and dfnet are independent Git projects located under ~/git/dfXXX (e.g. /home/df/git/dfnet).
- When modifying, debugging, or adding features to dfdisk, dfmount, or dfnet: ALWAYS make changes in ~/git/dfXXX, test with cargo check/test, and keep dfnix/pkgs/ synced if applicable.
- Never modify a tool solely inside dfnix/pkgs/ when an upstream repo exists.
- Run `make check` in dfnix before finishing any edits.
